### Get all songs
GET http://localhost:3000/songs

### Get one song
GET http://localhost:3000/songs/1

### Create song
POST http://localhost:3000/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Song name"
}

### Update song
PUT http://localhost:3000/songs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New name"
}

### Delete song
DELETE http://localhost:3000/songs/1